    "description": "<p><b>Requires:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hand\" title=\"Hand\">Hand</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Claw\" title=\"Claw\">Claw</a> Appendage</p><p>Claws designed to grip a surface can be added to any Droid with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hand\" title=\"Hand\">Hand</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Claw\" title=\"Claw\">Claw</a> Appendage. Climbing Claws grant the Droid a climb speed equal to one-half of its base speed. In addition, a Droid equipped with Climbing Claws may reroll a failed <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Climb\" title=\"Climb\">Climb</a> check (keeping the better result) and can <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Take_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Take 10\">Take 10</a> on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Climb\" title=\"Climb\">Climb</a> checks even when rushed or threatened. While in use, a Climbing Claw cannot be used for any other action. Climbing Claws double the cost of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Appendages\" title=\"Appendages\">Appendage</a>.</p>",
    "cost": "Appendage Cost x 2",
    "requires": "Hand or Claw Appendage"
  },
